# 🎓 Student Registration System

A web-based Student Registration System developed using the LEMP stack
and deployed on an AWS EC2 Ubuntu server.

## 🚀 Technologies Used

- AWS EC2
- Ubuntu
- Nginx
- PHP 8.5
- MariaDB
- HTML
- CSS
- Git
- GitHub
- VS Code

## ☁️ AWS Deployment

The application was deployed on an AWS EC2 instance running Ubuntu.

## 🏗️ Architecture

Browser
↓
Nginx
↓
PHP-FPM
↓
MariaDB

## ✨ Features

- Student Registration
- Student Data Storage
- MariaDB Database
- PHP Backend
- Nginx Web Server
- AWS EC2 Deployment

## 📂 Project Structure

student-registration-system/

├── index.php  
├── style.css  
├── submit.php  
├── students.php  
├── database.sql  
├── README.md  
└── .gitignore

